 sequel  prequel or some sort of continuation is  actually  very likely i think that eventually it  really will happen  even if it wasn't initially planned by  the author koyoharu gotoge  and let me explain why to say that demon  slayer has blown up in popularity in the  past year or two  would be a massive understatement in  terms of manga sales already in 2019  demon slayer was posting impressive  numbers  for 11 years before that one piece was  the biggest  selling manga but then in 2019  it was overtaken by demon slayer  one piece sold about 10 million and  demon slayers sold about 12 million  this is already really impressive for a  manga that hasn't been going on nearly  as long as one piece  but that was just the beginning the  first season of the demon slayer  anime was also released in 2019 and it  led to an  absolute explosion in the manga's  popularity  worldwide in just the first half of 2020  demon slayer sold an insane 45 million  two hundred ninety seven thousand six  hundred and thirty three volumes  and that is compared to just under five  million volumes for one piece  in that same time period that is  unfreaking believable and it is also a  new all-time record for a manga yearly  volume  sales and this is just for the first  half of the year  not even all of 2020 wow just  wow and if that wasn't enough the new  demon slayer movie which covers the  demon train or mugen train arc of the  manga  has also been breaking records at the  box office  believe it or not the movie's release  set the record for the best  ever opening weekend in japanese cinema  history  in spite of the fact that it was  released during  a global pandemic and again despite the  pandemic  the demon slayer movie became one of the  top 10 highest grossing films in  japanese history  within 17 days of its release and  no i don't mean top 10 highest grossing  anime films  i mean top 10 highest grossing films  period these numbers are so crazy that i  had to verify them with my brot